4. End-to-End CI/CD: GitHub Actions + Docker + K8s

Created a deploy.yml file for the CI/CD pipeline. Whenever changes are pushed to the develop branch, the pipeline will automatically trigger.

Steps in the GitHub Actions workflow:
  1. Check out the repository and set up Python.
  2. Install the required packages from requirements.txt.
  3. Build the Docker image using the Dockerfile.
  4. Push the Docker image to Docker Hub.
  5. Use Minikube to pull the image from Docker Hub and deploy it using the Deployment and Service manifests.